Add a gpu_vram_used sysmon stat reporting bytes

sysmon reports RAM two ways, ram_used in bytes and ram_pct, and disk four
ways, but VRAM only as gpu_vram, whose label is hardcoded to a percentage.
noctalia's own control centre already prints VRAM in GiB via
formatGpuVramUsed, so the bar widget is the odd one out.

This mirrors the ram_used/ram_pct pairing rather than redefining gpu_vram:
the new stat shares the same probe, thresholds, gauge ratio, display name and
glyph, and differs only in formatting the label with formatBinaryBytesAsGib.
Nothing existing changes behaviour.

